hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"51","[AI-translation] Hamain hadith sunayi 'Abdullah bin As-Sabbah Al-Hashimi Al-Basri ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi 'Ubaidullah bin Musa ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Isra'il ne, 'Abbad bin Mansur se, (h) aur hamain hadith sunayi 'Ali bin Hujar ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Yazeed bin Haroon ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi 'Abbad bin Mansur ne, 'Ikrimah se, Ibn 'Abbas se, kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam sone se qabl ithmid se surma lagate the, har aankh mein teen martaba. Aur Yazeed bin Haroon ne apni hadith mein kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ki ek surma dani thi jis se wo sote waqt surma lagate the, har aankh mein teen martaba."
"52","[AI-translation] Hamain hadith sunayi Ahmad bin Mani' ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Muhammad bin Yazeed ne, Muhammad bin Ishaq se, Muhammad bin Al-Munkadir se, Jabir yaani Ibn 'Abdullah se, kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum ithmid sote waqt lagaya karo, kyunke wo aankh ko roshan karta hai aur baal ugata hai."
"53","[AI-translation] Hamain hadith sunayi Qutaibah bin Sa'eed ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Bishr bin Al-Mufaddal ne, 'Abdullah bin 'Uthman bin Khuthaim se, Sa'eed bin Jubair se, Ibn 'Abbas se, kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Beshak tumhare behtareen surma mein ithmid hai, jo aankh ko roshan karta hai aur baal ugata hai."
"54","[AI-translation] Hamain hadith sunayi Ibrahim bin Al-Mustamir Al-Basri ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Abu 'Aasim ne, 'Uthman bin 'Abdul Malik se, Salim se, Ibn 'Umar se, kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum ithmid lagaya karo, pas beshak wo aankh ko roshan karta hai aur baal ugata hai."
"55","[AI-translation] Hamain hadith sunayi Muhammad bin Humaid Ar-Razi ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Al-Fazl bin Musa, Abu Tumailah aur Zaid bin Hubab ne, 'Abdul Mu'min bin Khalid se, 'Abdullah bin Buraidah se, Umm Salamah se, kahi: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko sab se mehboob libas qamees tha."
